<p>Dear <%= @owner.try(:username) || @owner.try(:email) %>,</p>

<p>Thank you for your purchase. Please find the details of your order below:</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Order Summary</h3>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size: 14px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Order Number:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @order.order_number %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Product:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @order.product.name %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Quantity:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @order.quantity %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Transaction ID:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @order.metadata['transaction_id'] || 'N/A' %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">Total Amount:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: right; color: #10b981;">
        <%= @order.total_amount %> USD
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>Our team is currently provisioning your services. You will receive another email with your credentials shortly.</p>

<p>Log in to your dashboard to manage your orders: <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/dashboard" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none;">Go to Dashboard</a></p>

<p>Best Regards,<br>The ProxySock Team</p>
